= Agent setup --- cold shell to first green gate

The cold-start guide has moved to the repository-root `AGENTS.md`.

`AGENTS.md` is now the single home for instructions meant for AI agents. It
carries the MCP gate, the tool matrix, navigation rules, the SageFs inner loop,
the build and test gate, formatting, change discipline, the F\# engineering
rules, concurrent work, recipes, and troubleshooting.

The Typst documents under `docs/` and `README.typ` describe the project; they no
longer duplicate those rules. Read `AGENTS.md` before your first command.
